  "releaseNotes": "ChangeLog\n      ---------\n      0.7    TemplateStrings.UseDefaultsHintedToDestructureState() logs {@State}, for Serilog and NLog destructuring. Serilog.Assert uses it by default.\n      0.6    ElseThrow methods now log and throw typed assertion, precondition, and postcondition failures.\n      0.5    Log multiple additional named properties when given usefulState:new {...} anonymous object.\n      0.4    Support Net4x, Net5, netstandard1.6-2.1\n      0.3    Re-order optional parameters, action is last, usefulState first | Rename usefulState from helpfulInformation\n      0.2    Downgrade dependencies (Serilog 2.10, Extensions.Logging..Abstraction fx.0.0)\n      0.1    First release",
